      "pinyin": "wǒ kàn zhe tā tā yě kàn zhe wǒ tā yě ná zhe dàn gāo",
      "english": "I looked at him, and he looked at me. He was also holding a cake."
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "simplified": "他是妈妈的同学吗？他也想和妈妈一起过生日吗？",
      "traditional": "他是媽媽的同學嗎？他也想和媽媽一起過生日嗎？",
      "pinyin": "tā shì mā ma de tóng xué ma tā yě xiǎng hé mā ma yì qǐ guò shēng rì ma",
      "english": "Was he Mom’s classmate? Did he also want to celebrate Mom’s birthday with her?"
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "simplified": "\n    ",
      "traditional": "\n    ",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "simplified": "“妈妈不在家。”我对他说，但是他没有听见。",
      "traditional": "“媽媽不在家。”我對他說，但是他沒有聽見。",
      "pinyin": "mā ma bú zài jiā wǒ duì tā shuō dàn shì tā méi yǒu tīng jiàn",
      "english": "“Mom is not at home,” I said to him, but he didn’t hear."
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "simplified": "\n    ",
      "traditional": "\n    ",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "simplified": "他在门外等了很长时间。我睡觉了，又起来了，他还在门外。",
      "traditional": "他在門外等了很長時間。我睡覺了，又起來了，他還在門外。",
      "pinyin": "tā zài mén wài děng le hěn cháng shí jiān wǒ shuì jiào le yòu qǐ lai le tā hái zài mén wài",
      "english": "He waited for a long time outside the door. I went to sleep. When I got up again, he was still outside the door."
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "simplified": "\n    ",
      "traditional": "\n    ",
