    "sentence_translations": [
      "Who Was He?",
      "",
      "Who was this man outside the door?",
      "",
      "“Who are you?” I asked, but he didn’t hear.",
      "",
      "I looked at him, and he looked at me. He was also holding a cake.",
      "Was he Mom’s classmate? Did he also want to celebrate Mom’s birthday with her?",
      "",
      "“Mom is not at home,” I said to him, but he didn’t hear.",
      "",
      "He waited for a long time outside the door. I went to sleep. When I got up again, he was still outside the door.",
      "",
      "It was still raining outside. I thought that he was very cold.",
      "",
      "“Mom is not at home,” I said to him again. Did he want to wait until Mom came back?",
      "But Mom and Dad had gone out. They were eating out tonight, and he would have to wait for a long, long time.",
      "",
      "Who was he? Did Mom know him?",
      ""
